        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Pydro\"]\n\n...when someone is making a suboptimal move in the tournament? We hear Christopher&#39;s reaction, &quot;No, don&#39;t move away, use Hypsersonic Assault for a third time!&quot; However, we can&#39;t see or hear your reaction.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nDisclaimer: I am not Paul.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nFor myself, though, what makes watching people playing Tactics (and many other games) interesting is seeing what decisions they make differently than what I would do in their shoes. Different players have different play styles.\n\nUnless you&#39;re talking about things that are _strictly_ suboptimal, like dying with +1 Defense tokens in hand, or passing your last action instead of Dodging. Then I try not to get too much spit on the screen. :p\n",
